  "bio": {
    "zh": "Biagi 是幫 D'Arienzo 打造招牌節奏的鋼琴手，後來自組樂團。他保留強烈驅動感，但多了一個鮮明簽名：在樂句中突然留白，讓你腳下忽然「空」一下——像電梯往下墜半秒。",
    "en": "Biagi was the pianist who helped forge D'Arienzo's trademark beat, then led his own orchestra. He kept the drive, but added sudden gaps mid-phrase—like the floor dropping for half a second."
  },
  "sound_description": {
    "zh": "節奏基礎跟 D'Arienzo 一樣強烈，但會在穩定拍子裡安插意外停頓（切分／空隙），製造戲劇性的失重感。",
    "en": "As rhythmically assertive as D'Arienzo, but with surprise silences and syncopated gaps that create a dramatic weightless moment."
  },
